msgctxt "96"
msgid "Argh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Looks like that \"fact\" you were talking about just became fiction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Already gloating, huh? You have no idea what you're dealing with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "It'd be my pleasure to introduce you to my boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "He really hates your guts, so I'm sure he'd love to meet you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Who is this boss of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "You'll find out when you meet him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "When he's ready, we'll send a letter or something to the HLA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Until then, why don't you relax and watch the Kamurocho night sky while you "
"wait?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Hold it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "(Shit, I lost him...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "I'm sorry. Shinzaki got away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Did you get any leads?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Sounds like their boss is going to meet with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Finally! The man behind the Reapers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"All right. Please come back to headquarters so we can discuss what to do "
"next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"Very impressive, Kazuma Kiryu. Now I can see why our men were no match for "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "I was gonna do this later, but there's been a change in plans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "I'm finishing you off right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Pretty sure of yourself, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "It's not that I can't lose or that I don't wanna lose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "It's simply that I don't lose. It's just a fact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Now, let me show you what a real hitman can do!"
msgstr ""

